PDF backend source

The patched hayro 0.7.1, hayro-interpret 0.7.0, hayro-syntax 0.7.2 and hayro-jbig2 0.3.0
are fetched from https://github.com/storytold/craft-libs at revision
89dcbb3060377a26c99a6d80caa16084366704c4. The four source snapshots were transferred
from https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft at revision
7437bde378f43856eada40af25b983812e615e8a, then patched in craft-libs. Their upstream project is
